  m_Name: StoryLine_04
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryLineData
  speakerName: "Ph\xF3 l\xFD"
  title: "T\u1EF1 tay d\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i nh\xE0 c\u1EEDa"
  content: "Nh\u1EEFng ng\xE0y sau, c\u1EADu ta \u1EDF l\u1EA1i c\xF9ng ch\xFAng
    t\xF4i. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\u1EB1ng l\u1EDDi n\xF3i, m\xE0 b\u1EB1ng t\u1EEBng
    vi\xEAn g\u1EA1ch, t\u1EEBng t\u1EA5m v\xE1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t
    l\u1EA1i \u0111\xFAng ch\u1ED7. D\xE2n l\xE0ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u tin."
  portrait: {fileID: 1871985265, guid: 05340f7438bce374e96af080bb0729ad, type: 3}
